# RB3 web screen-shell_sfx dependency manifest — GENERATED, do not hand-edit.
# The shell's sound-effect working set: the W5 xma_pcm .ogg sidecars (+ their
# manifest.txt). On-demand these load as ~321 individual tiny XHRs (avg ~19 KB)
# right after the splash-screen ENTER — an RTT-bound trickle the user feels as
# "10+ seconds downloading sound effects". Served as ONE async bundle by
# server.py /api/bundle/screen/shell_sfx, prefetched during the intro movie
# (see kDefaultScreenBundleMap in native/src/main_web.cpp) so the bytes are
# MEMFS-resident before the user can press enter.
# DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED: the SFX bank .milo_xbox (guitar_fx/kit03_bank/
# tambourine_bank). They load at gameplay (3 XHRs, marginal), and one 50 Mbit
# run with them pre-resident hung the splash->main_hub transition in a
# suspended PollUntilLoaded (46 s rAF gap, idle CPU; 1-of-2 runs — flaky
# loader-ordering race when instant MEMFS opens interleave with slow
# network-bound loads). Not confirmed causal, kept out on cost/benefit.
# Source: measured full boot->game journey waterfall (netperf-suite nav,
# 2026-07-01). Regenerate: run `node scripts/web/netperf-suite.mjs --scenario
# nav --profiles local`, then extract every /api/file/sfx/gen/xma_pcm/* URL
# from the run's network-waterfall.json.
